{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\VirtualOffice\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "psalm/phar, phpunit/phpunit are in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Command/Purge.php:50 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteApp(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig  Removes all keys in appconfig belonging to the app."
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 35. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Command/Purge.php:50 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteApp(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig  Removes all keys in appconfig belonging to the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "template-inline-style",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "templates/talk-unavailable.php:8 style= attribute"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 inline style in templates/. The default Content Security Policy of the server allows inline style; a response whose policy disallows it drops them. A stylesheet added with OCP\\Util::addStyle() holds in both cases.",
        "  templates/talk-unavailable.php:8 style= attribute"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "job-time-sensitivity",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/BackgroundJob/PairRoulette.php OCA\\VirtualOffice\\BackgroundJob\\PairRoulette"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 timed job does not say whether it is time sensitive. A job that sets TIME_INSENSITIVE with setTimeSensitivity() is moved to the maintenance window of the server; whether a job is heavy enough for that only its maintainer knows.",
        "  lib/BackgroundJob/PairRoulette.php OCA\\VirtualOffice\\BackgroundJob\\PairRoulette"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/OfficeController.php:160 time()",
        "lib/Controller/OfficeController.php:188 time()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 2 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Controller/OfficeController.php:160 time()",
        "  lib/Controller/OfficeController.php:188 time()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config-without-lexicon",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/PushService.php:47 getValueString()",
        "lib/Service/Settings.php:24 getValueInt()",
        "lib/Service/Settings.php:28 setValueInt()",
